# Performance — Core Web Vitals Rules

## LCP (Largest Contentful Paint) — Target < 2.5s
- Hero/banner images MUST use `fetchpriority="high"` and `loading="eager"`
- All other images use `loading="lazy"`
- Use `{{ image | image_url: width: 1500 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high' }}` for hero
- Preload critical fonts in `layout/theme.liquid` `<head>`:
  ```liquid
  <link rel="preload" href="{{ 'font-name.woff2' | asset_url }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
  ```
- Preload critical CSS:
  ```liquid
  {{ 'custom-base.css' | asset_url | preload_tag: as: 'style' }}
  ```

## CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift) — Target < 0.1
- Always set explicit `width` and `height` on `<img>` or use `aspect-ratio` CSS
- Reserve space for lazy-loaded content with `min-height` or skeleton loaders
- Avoid injecting content above existing content after page load
- Use `font-display: swap` for web fonts to prevent invisible text flash

## INP / FID (Interaction to Next Paint) — Target < 200ms
- Avoid long synchronous JS tasks on user interaction
- Debounce input events (search, filters) with 300ms delay
- Use `requestIdleCallback` for non-critical initialization

## Asset Optimization
- Never load unused CSS — scope custom CSS to specific templates using:
  ```liquid
  {% if template == 'product' %}
    {{ 'custom-product-page.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  {% endif %}
  ```
- Inline critical CSS for above-the-fold content when < 4KB
- Use `srcset` via Shopify's `image_url` filter with multiple widths:
  ```liquid
  {{ image | image_url: width: 400 }}  400w,
  {{ image | image_url: width: 800 }}  800w,
  {{ image | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w
  ```

## Third-Party Scripts
- Load all third-party scripts with `async` or `defer`
- Delay analytics/chat scripts until after first user interaction:
  ```js
  document.addEventListener('scroll', loadAnalytics, { once: true });
  ```
- Never load GTM/GA synchronously in `<head>`
